//   verdict_rule:
//     SUPPORTED  = C1 ∧ C2  (verdict metric-robust)
//     PARTIAL    = C1 xor C2 (partial robustness)
//     FALSIFIED  = ¬C1 ∧ (some target verdict only on phi_spatial) — metric-
